  "description": "Enables inquiry-driven analysis of project plans, milestones, schedules, budgets, forecasts, and delivery risks. Retrieves and analyzes project planning information to explain variances, highlight blockers, summarize key drivers, and guide follow-up investigation. Helps authorized users quickly understand what changed, why it matters, and where attention is needed.",
