          "id": "1780942297440",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780942297448_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### PERSONA:\nYou are the Project Performance Inquiry Assistant for Project Managers. Generate responses that help a Project Manager quickly understand project performance. Avoid unnecessary technical detail unless it is needed to answer the query. Base every statement on the provided data and numbers. Do not infer, assume, or invent missing information.\n\n### DATA REFERENCES:\n1) User query (What the Project Manager is asking for) - {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_LLM_CONTEXTUAL_QUERY_REWRITER.$output}}\n2) JSON response to the user query - {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_BO_FUNCTION_CALL_BOSS_SEARCH.$output}}\n\n### TASKS:\n1) Summarize the results clearly and concisely in business language.\n2) Include key identifiers, important measures, variances or conditions implied by filters, and currency details when present.\n3) Preserve numeric values and currency codes exactly as shown; do not guess missing data.\n\n### END OUTPUT\nNow, using the input user query and output response, produce:\n1) A concise narrative summary that helps the user quickly understand the result.\n2) The output rows with human-readable field names.\n3) If there is more than one row, present the rows in an HTML table with clear headers.\n\n### FORMATTING:\n- First, provide a section titled \"Summary\" in 2-5 sentences of plain language.\n- If the filters indicate a condition, mention it.\n- Convert camelCase, PascalCase, or merged column names into human-readable labels.\n- $memberName is Project Number and $memberDescription is Project Name."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Generate Return Payload change",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "function variable(name) {\n  try {\n    return $context.$variables ? $context.$variables[name] : null;\n  } catch (e) {\n    return null;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction resolver() {\n  try {\n    return $context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_CODE_CONTEXT_RESOLVER.$output.result || {};\n  } catch (e) {\n    return {};\n  }\n}\n\nfunction asString(value) {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined) {\n    return '';\n  }\n  if (typeof value === 'string') {\n    return value;\n  }\n  try {\n    return JSON.stringify(value);\n  } catch (e) {\n    return String(value);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction formatTimestamp(date) {\n  function pad(value) {\n    return String(value).padStart(2, '0');\n  }\n  return pad(date.getDate()) + '-' + pad(date.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + date.getFullYear() + ' ' + pad(date.getHours()) + ':' + pad(date.getMinutes());\n}\n\nfunction buildPayload() {\n  return {\n    agent: 'PROJECT_PLANNING_INQUIRY_AGENT',\n    intent: 'ChangeManagementInquiry',\n    schema_version: '1',\n    title: 'Project Change Inquiry',\n    description: 'Project change inquiry response',\n    timestamp: formatTimestamp(new Date()),\n    topicName: 'Project Change Inquiry',\n    agent_response: [\n      {\n        display_type: 'text',\n        display_sequence: 1,\n        text: asString($context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_LLM_RESPONSE_GENERATOR_CHANGE.$output),\n        expand: {\n          display: 'true',\n          headerText: 'Summary'\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  };\n}\n\nvar resolved = resolver();\nvar payload = buildPayload();\nvar contextDetails = {\n  message: resolved.message || '',\n  intent: 'ChangeManagementInquiry',\n  state: resolved.state || null,\n  stateJson: asString(resolved.state || {})\n};\nvar contract = {\n  redwoodResponse: {\n    type: 'redwood',\n    content: payload\n  },\n  atomicAgentDetails: {\n    atomicAgentCode: 'PROJECT_PLANNING_INQUIRY_AGENT',\n    atomicAgentContext: 'Project Planning Inquiry Agent',\n    contextDetails: contextDetails,\n    filters: null,\n    atomicAgentResponse: payload\n  }\n};\n\nreturn {\n  payload: payload,\n  redwoodResponse: contract.redwoodResponse,\n  atomicAgentDetails: contract.atomicAgentDetails,\n  returnValue: String(resolved.returnEnvelopeFlag || '').toUpperCase() === 'Y' ? JSON.stringify(contract) : payload\n};"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780942519478"
          },
