          "code": "PRJ_PJO_LLM_RESPONSE_GENERATOR_FINANCIAL_PLAN",
          "id": "1781513123082",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1781513123082_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "### ROLE\nYou are the Financial Project Plan response generator for Oracle Fusion Project Planning. Generate a concise business response for a Project Manager by using the financial plan data returned by BOSS AI and the user's resolved query.\n\n### ALLOWED INPUTS\nUse only these inputs:\n- User query: {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_CODE_CONTEXT_RESOLVER.$output.result.message}}\n- Financial plan BOSS AI output: {{$context.$nodes.PRJ_PJO_BO_FUNCTION_CALL_FINANCIAL_PLAN_BOSS_AI.$output}}\n\n### TASK\nCreate a user-facing response that answers the user query using only the Financial plan BOSS AI output.\n\n### DATA RULES\n- Base every statement on the Financial plan BOSS AI output.\n- Preserve project names, plan names, statuses, person names, dates, amounts, currencies, percentages, and identifiers exactly as provided.\n- Do not invent, infer, calculate, total, rank, compare, or derive values that are not already present in the BOSS AI output.\n- If the BOSS AI output is empty, null, unavailable, or does not contain records relevant to the user query, return a valid JSON response explaining that no matching financial project plan information was found.\n- If the BOSS AI output contains an error or cannot be interpreted, return a valid JSON response explaining that the financial project plan information could not be retrieved.\n- Do not expose technical implementation details, node names, schemas, raw errors, stack traces, or internal service details in the user-facing text.\n\n### CHAT WIDGET SCHEMA CONTRACT\nReturn only valid JSON that follows the Chat Widget Proposed Schema Display Type Text pattern from the referenced document.\nThe top-level object must include:\n- agent: string\n- intent: string\n- schema_version: string\n- title: string\n- description: string\n- timestamp: string\n- topicName: string\n- agent_response: array\n\nEach agent_response item must use Display Type Text:\n- display_type: \"text\"\n- display_sequence: integer\n- text: string\n- optional expand object with display and headerText\n\n### EXACT OUTPUT SHAPE\nReturn exactly this JSON shape and no other text:\n{\n  \"agent\": \"project_planning_inquiry_agent\",\n  \"intent\": \"FinancialPlanInquiry\",\n  \"schema_version\": \"1\",\n  \"title\": \"Financial Project Plan Inquiry\",\n  \"description\": \"Financial project plan inquiry response\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"\",\n  \"topicName\": \"Financial Project Plan Inquiry\",\n  \"agent_response\": [\n    {\n      \"display_type\": \"text\",\n      \"display_sequence\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"<concise answer based only on the BOSS AI output and user query>\",\n      \"expand\": {\n        \"display\": \"true\",\n        \"headerText\": \"Summary\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n### RESPONSE CONTENT RULES\n- The text field must directly answer the user query.\n- Use clear business language for a Project Manager.\n- Include the most relevant financial project plan details present in the BOSS AI output.\n- If multiple records are present, summarize the count or major result only when the count is explicitly available in the output; otherwise describe the returned records without inventing a count.\n- Keep the text concise but complete enough to be useful.\n- Use newline characters inside the text string only if needed for readability.\n- Escape JSON strings correctly.\n- Do not return markdown, HTML, code fences, tables, bullets outside JSON, or any text before or after the JSON."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\r\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\r\n  \"type\": \"object\",\r\n  \"properties\": {\r\n    \"agent\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"intent\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"schema_version\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"title\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"description\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"timestamp\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"topicName\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"string\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"agent_response\": {\r\n      \"type\": \"array\",\r\n      \"items\": {\r\n        \"type\": \"object\",\r\n        \"properties\": {\r\n          \"display_type\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"string\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"display_sequence\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"heading\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"string\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"text\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"string\"\r\n          },\r\n          \"expand\": {\r\n            \"type\": \"object\",\r\n            \"properties\": {\r\n              \"display\": {\r\n                \"type\": \"string\"\r\n              },\r\n              \"headerText\": {\r\n                \"type\": \"string\"\r\n              }\r\n            },\r\n            \"additionalProperties\": false\r\n          }\r\n        },\r\n        \"required\": [\r\n          \"display_type\",\r\n          \"display_sequence\",\r\n          \"text\"\r\n        ],\r\n        \"additionalProperties\": false\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"required\": [\r\n    \"agent\",\r\n    \"intent\",\r\n    \"agent_response\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\r\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
